  },
  {
    q: "Does renewing restore everything automatically?",
    a: "Yes. Premium is a state, not a migration — the moment a new subscription activates, every feature returns exactly as it was, including your badge, animated avatar and raised limits."
  },
  {
    q: "Is there an auto-renewal through StarsJoy?",
    a: "No. Purchases through a reseller are one-off, which means nothing is charged to a card in the background and there is no subscription to cancel. The trade-off is that you have to renew manually when the term ends."
  }
];
